        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3715, Solid Brass Chic Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe sleekness of this cabinet door pull made by RK International comes from the clean lines of the design. The Chic Cabinet Pull is easy to clean, easy to install, and easy to love. It is beautiful, modern, and timeless. It is available in a 3 inch, 3-1/2 inch, or 4 inch center to center. Choose from the 6 available finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3715 Simple Chic Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3715</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3316</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3317</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
